{"seq":1,"slug":"query-translation","title":"查询翻译路线及其误差传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-language-retrieval/clir-approaches/query-translation","wordCount":2601,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询翻译路线及其误差传播\">查询翻译路线及其误差传播</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>查询翻译（query translation，简称 QT）是跨语言检索里改动最小的做法：保持文档索引完全不变，在查询进入倒排索引之前把它翻译成文档语言。一个法语用户搜 <code>écouteurs sans fil</code>，系统把它翻成 <code>wireless earbuds</code>，然后走原本的英文检索链路——分词、BM25、排序，一个环节都不改。</p>\n<p>它的吸引力在于侵入性极低。你不需要重建索引，不需要 GPU 在线推理，不需要多份语言副本；只需要在检索链路的最前端插一个翻译调用。对于一个已经把单语言搜索跑得很好的系统，这是唯一一条能在两周内上线的跨语言路径。</p>\n<p>代价同样明确：<strong>把翻译放在了在线路径上</strong>。每一次检索都要调用翻译服务，每一次翻译错误都会立刻、且不可逆地变成召回损失。文档翻译路线把这份代价挪到了离线（见 <a href=\"document-translation\">文档翻译索引路线</a>），共享向量空间路线则干脆取消了显式翻译（见 <a href=\"shared-embedding-space\">多语言共享向量空间路线</a>）。理解 QT 的关键就在于理解它的误差是怎么传播的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;用户查询&lt;br/&gt;écouteurs sans fil&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;翻译服务&lt;br/&gt;MT / 词典 / LLM&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;候选译文&lt;br/&gt;wireless earbuds&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;译文质量检查&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|通过| E[&quot;查询改写&lt;br/&gt;同义词扩展 / 加权&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|失败| F[&quot;原文兜底&lt;br/&gt;走词法或向量旁路&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;倒排检索&lt;br/&gt;BM25&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;候选文档集&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I{&quot;召回是否充足&quot;}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[&quot;多译法并行&lt;br/&gt;再检索一次&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt;|是| K[&quot;排序&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L[&quot;结果&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"用户查询&lt;br/&gt;écouteurs sans fil\"] --&gt; B[\"翻译服务&lt;br/&gt;MT / 词典 / LLM\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"候选译文&lt;br/&gt;wireless earbuds\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"译文质量检查\"}\n    D --&gt;|通过| E[\"查询改写&lt;br/&gt;同义词扩展 / 加权\"]\n    D --&gt;|失败| F[\"原文兜底&lt;br/&gt;走词法或向量旁路\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"倒排检索&lt;br/&gt;BM25\"]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[\"候选文档集\"]\n    H --&gt; I{\"召回是否充足\"}\n    I --&gt;|否| J[\"多译法并行&lt;br/&gt;再检索一次\"]\n    I --&gt;|是| K[\"排序\"]\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L[\"结果\"]</pre><p>这张图里有两处是 QT 独有的、别处不存在的设计点：<code>D</code>（译文质量检查）和 <code>J</code>（多译法回退）。它们之所以必要，是因为 <code>B</code> 是一个会出错的外部依赖，而它的错误无法被下游的任何环节修正——BM25 不会知道 <code>wireless earbuds</code> 其实漏掉了原查询里的 <code>filaires</code> 含义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"误差传播的链路解剖\">误差传播的链路解剖</h2><p>把 QT 的召回损失写成可分析的形式。设查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 在源语言下有语义单元集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(q) = \\{t_1, \\dots, t_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（可以理解为查询里所有「有检索价值的词」），翻译函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 把它映射为目标语言词集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(T(q))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。若文档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 真正匹配的是其中某个子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\subseteq T(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，那么 QT 的召回依赖一个条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\cap M^{-1}(M(T(q))) \\neq \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直观地说：翻译必须<strong>保留</strong>至少一个匹配单元。翻译造成的损失因此有三种形态，而且它们的召回签名完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误差形态</th>\n<th>例子（法→英）</th>\n<th>传导结果</th>\n<th>召回签名</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>漏译（omission）</td>\n<td><code>écouteurs sans fil étanches</code> → <code>wireless earbuds</code>（丢 <code>étanches</code>/防水）</td>\n<td>目标词项缺失</td>\n<td>大量结果，但全部不满足隐含约束；排序质量下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>术语错译（term mismatch）</td>\n<td><code>chargeur</code> → <code>loader</code>（应为 <code>charger</code>）</td>\n<td>目标词项错误</td>\n<td>召回空洞，零结果或极少量结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度消歧（narrowing）</td>\n<td><code>écouteurs</code> → <code>in-ear headphones</code>（排除了头戴式）</td>\n<td>目标词项过窄</td>\n<td>召回量下降，但精度上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多义误选（ambiguity）</td>\n<td><code>capot</code> → <code>hood</code>（汽车引擎盖）而非手机壳</td>\n<td>目标词项指向错领域</td>\n<td>结果完全离题，用户零点击</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的实用价值在于：<strong>你可以从召回日志反推误差形态</strong>。零结果率突然上升说明术语错译；结果数正常但点击率下降说明漏译或过度消歧；结果离题说明多义误选。</p>\n<p>漏译的伤害常被低估。它不产生零结果，因此不触发任何告警，但用户明确表达的约束——防水、无线、儿童、二手——被悄悄丢弃了。检索系统返回了一堆「看起来相关」的耳机，用户翻了两页找不到他要的，退出。这在指标上表现为<strong>长点击缺失与低转化</strong>，而不是召回问题，因此极容易被归因到排序团队。</p>\n<p>过度消歧是另一类反直觉的损失。<code>écouteurs</code> 在法语里涵盖入耳式与头戴式，若翻译模型选了 <code>in-ear headphones</code>，检索就会系统性丢掉头戴式商品。讽刺的是，如果把它交给人类翻译，人类通常会选择更宽的上位词以保留歧义；而神经翻译模型倾向于输出<strong>最可能的单一译法</strong>，因为它的训练目标就是最大化单句似然。这解释了为什么「翻译得越像人话」有时反而召回越差——人话是消歧后的，检索要的是保留歧义。相关的兜底策略在 <a href=\"../translation-quality/mt-errors-recall\">MT 错误（漏译/术语错）对召回的影响</a> 中有完整展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多译法扩展-把单点翻译变成分布\">多译法扩展：把单点翻译变成分布</h2><p>既然单次翻译会窄化，直接的补救是不要只取一个译文。三种做法按成本递增排列：</p>\n<p><strong>n-best 列表。</strong> 大多数 MT 服务支持返回前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个候选译句（beam search 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条）。它们的差异往往正是系统需要的歧义面：<code>wireless earbuds</code> / <code>wireless headphones</code> / <code>wireless earphones</code> 三条候选一起送进检索，覆盖了原查询的宽度。工程上通常把它们拼成一个布尔或（<code>A OR B OR C</code>），或对每条候选分别检索后做结果融合。</p>\n<p><strong>术语级多译法（词汇替换）。</strong> 句级 n-best 的差异是整句级的，粒度太粗。更精准的做法是从双语词典或 MT 的注意力对齐中抽取<strong>词级</strong>候选集，对每个实词独立扩展：<code>étanches → {waterproof, water-resistant, water resistant}</code>。这也是为什么第三章第二节强调品牌与型号需要保护——词级扩展会让品牌名被错误扩展成一堆同义词。</p>\n<p><strong>回译验证（back-translation check）。</strong> 把候选译文再翻回源语言，与原文比对：若回译结果与原文的词重叠度低于阈值，说明这次翻译丢失了信息，应当触发多译法回退或原文旁路。回译的成本是正常翻译的两倍（一次正向、一次反向），但它把「翻译是否可信」变成了一个可计算的信号。回译指标（如 BLEU 或 chrF 的自比对）不需要参考译文，因此可以完全无监督地在线运行。</p>\n<p>一条实用的打分口径是给每条候选译文一个权重，而不是等权合并：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(c) = \\alpha \\cdot p_{MT}(c \\mid q) + \\beta \\cdot \\mathrm{sim}(c, \\mathrm{backtrans}(c)) - \\gamma \\cdot |\\mathrm{len}(c) - \\mathrm{len}(q)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">backtrans</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">len</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">len</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中第一项来自翻译模型的概率，第二项来自回译一致性，第三项惩罚长度失衡（长度剧变通常意味着漏译或过度意译）。系数需要按语言对调，但即便取最简单的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=\\beta=1, \\gamma=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，效果也显著优于只用 top-1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"枢轴语言与桥接\">枢轴语言与桥接</h2><p>很多语言对的平行语料稀少，直接翻译质量差。常见对策是<strong>枢轴（pivot）</strong>：把源语言先翻成资源丰富的中间语言（几乎总是英语），再翻成目标语言。<code>泰语 → 英语 → 波兰语</code> 比 <code>泰语 → 波兰语</code> 的直译更可靠，因为泰英与英波两段各自有充足训练数据。</p>\n<p>枢轴的代价是误差<strong>相乘</strong>而非相加。设单段翻译保留原语义单元的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，两段枢轴的保留概率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.85</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>direct</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.85</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>pivot</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7225</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.85 \\implies p_{\\text{direct}} = 0.85,\\quad p_{\\text{pivot}} = 0.7225</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6684em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">direct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9305em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pivot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7225</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这解释了为什么枢轴方案必须配 n-best 或词级扩展——单链路的损失已经被平方过了。更隐蔽的问题是枢轴的<strong>语义漂移累积</strong>：中文 <code>鸭舌帽</code> → 英语 <code>baseball cap</code> → 德语 <code>Baseballkappe</code> 是对的，但中文 <code>雪纺</code> → 英语 <code>chiffon</code> → 某些语言的 <code>chiffon</code> 同时指蛋糕奶油，第二段可能选错义项，而第一段完全正确。你无法从任一段的输出单独发现这个错误。</p>\n<p>工程上的缓释手段是<strong>跳过枢轴直达词法</strong>：对低资源语言对，先做源语言到目标语言的<strong>双语词典直接映射</strong>（覆盖率低但零漂移），把成功映射的部分当作高置信词项加权，剩余的走枢轴。这与第三章第三节的音译匹配是同一思路在不同层面的应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时延-成本与缓存\">时延、成本与缓存</h2><p>QT 把翻译放在关键路径上，因此时延预算是硬约束。一个典型跨境搜索的在线预算分配大致如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n<th>占比</th>\n<th>可优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>翻译调用（MT API）</td>\n<td>40–200 ms</td>\n<td>最大单项</td>\n<td>缓存、批量、本地小模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询改写与扩展</td>\n<td>5–20 ms</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>预热词典、避免远程查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倒排检索</td>\n<td>10–50 ms</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>常规搜索优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序（含粗排/精排）</td>\n<td>50–300 ms</td>\n<td>中到大</td>\n<td>与翻译并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果组装与返回</td>\n<td>5–20 ms</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键优化是<strong>缓存与并行</strong>。查询翻译的结果有极高的重复率——电商头部查询的分布是长尾的，但热查询（占流量 30%–50%）的翻译结果是稳定的，可以按 <code>(源语言, 目标语言, 规范化查询)</code> 做键缓存，命中率在成熟站点通常能到 40%–60%。缓存把平均时延拉低，p99 则要靠超时降级解决：翻译超时（比如 300 ms）时直接返回原文检索结果或走向量旁路，而不是让整个查询失败。</p>\n<p>另一个常被忽视的优化是<strong>把翻译与排序并行</strong>。若系统同时具备原文词法检索能力（比如索引里存了原文的 transliteration 或罗马化形式），可以在翻译请求发出的同时并行跑一次原文检索，谁先返回用谁的结果做候选合并。这样翻译的时延被藏在了检索背后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>QT 的定位是「最小改动跨语言」，把翻译放在在线路径，误差即刻变成召回损失但保留了在线干预能力。</li>\n<li>误差有四种形态，召回签名各不相同：漏译表现为结果正常但点击下降，术语错译表现为召回空洞，过度消歧表现为召回量下降，多义误选表现为结果离题。</li>\n<li>用召回日志的形态反推误差类型，是定位 QT 事故最快的路径。</li>\n<li>单次翻译必然窄化查询，n-best、词级扩展、回译验证是三种成本递增的补救。</li>\n<li>枢轴语言让误差相乘，低资源语言对应改用双语词典直连 + 枢轴混合。</li>\n<li>缓存（热查询）与超时降级（长尾）是 QT 在线时延的两根支柱；把翻译与检索并行可以进一步隐藏翻译开销。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：若你的语言对翻译质量长期不达标，说明成本应该挪到离线——读 <a href=\"document-translation\">文档翻译索引路线</a>；若你的查询口语化严重、翻译总是抓不住意图，向量路线可能更合适——见 <a href=\"shared-embedding-space\">多语言共享向量空间路线</a>，其实现在 <a href=\"../multilingual-embeddings/vector-lexical-hybrid-clir\">向量+词法混合跨语言检索</a> 中给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询翻译路线及其误差传播","id":"查询翻译路线及其误差传播"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"误差传播的链路解剖","id":"误差传播的链路解剖"},{"level":2,"text":"多译法扩展：把单点翻译变成分布","id":"多译法扩展-把单点翻译变成分布"},{"level":2,"text":"枢轴语言与桥接","id":"枢轴语言与桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"时延、成本与缓存","id":"时延-成本与缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"文档翻译索引路线与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-language-retrieval/clir-approaches/document-translation"}}